---
import GameLayout from "../../../layouts/GameLayout.astro";
---

<GameLayout title="OverTheWire: Bandit Level 15" gameName="bandit" level={15}>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-500 mt-6 mb-2">Level Goal</h2>

    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The password for the next level is retrieved by submitting the password
        of the current level to
        <strong>port 30000 on localhost</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-500 mt-6 mb-2">
        Commands you may need to solve this level
    </h2>

    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">ssh, telnet, nc, openssl, s_client, nmap</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-500 mt-6 mb-2">
        Helpful Reading Material
    </h2>

    <ul class="list-disc list-inside pl-4 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        <li>
            <a
                href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Netcat"
                class="text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-300 no-underline"
                >How to use socket to send data to a TCP port in shell script
                (at the bottom) or use nc</a>
        </li>
    </ul>
</GameLayout>
